        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5001-454, 4-1/2\" x 4\" x Square Corners Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one (1) complete hinge with matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel button tip hinge pin. Medium duty door hinge, standard .134\" thickness. Standard full mortise hinge with 5 knuckle design and button tips. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-BB5001-454-hinge_size.gif?v=1704442271\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer BB5001-454 Brass Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer BB5001-454 4-1/2\" x 4\" Brass Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel, Removable</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearing: 2 Ball Bearings</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A2112 for Ball Bearing Hinges</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: 4 ea. #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: 8 ea. #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5001-454.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer BB5001-454 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>Note: </b> This item is normally <b>special order. Please allow 4 weeks</b> to ship.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
